# Tripwire, not a home.
#
# Working notes for this repository live in ../d-dolar-notes, a PRIVATE
# sibling repository. Nothing should be written here on purpose -- see
# CLAUDE.md.
#
# This directory survives only so that a tool which still writes to the old
# location cannot leak into a push: this repository's remote is intended to
# be PUBLIC, and notes quote whatever was discussed, which can include
# material that should stay private.
#
# So: everything here is ignored, and this file is tracked so the rule
# arrives with a fresh clone. Do not add an exception below -- move the file
# to ../d-dolar-notes instead, or to docs/ if it is meant to be read by
# others.
*
!.gitignore
